<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#sumerian-language">Glossary</a> · Term · language</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sumerian language</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Sumerian language was the language of ancient <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sumer">Sumer</a>, one of the earliest written languages. It is unrelated to any known language. It was used for administration under the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/third-dynasty-of-ur">Third Dynasty of Ur</a>.</p></div>
